emmo:EMMO_12b2ec1e_fb89_468a_a51d_97c2a6db297c a owl:Class;
                                               rdfs:comment "ratio of the product of ion molality b and a correction factor γ to the molality b° of the same ion in a standard solution under standardized conditions: a = bγ / b°."@en,
