sin(x) = y"""@en;
                                               skos:prefLabel "Equation"@en;
                                               emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "The class of 'mathematical'-s that stand for a statement of equality between two mathematical expressions."@en.
